{"type": "concept", "subtype": "anti-pattern", "title": "过度干预的常见错误做法", "content": "孩子考试没考好时，父母常见的错误做法包括：去问老师、跟老师沟通孩子最近是否上课不认真、跟孩子沟通为什么考不好。这些都是越界和过度干预。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["越界", "过度干预", "考试"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-1ad2923d2924-c001:a026", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-1ad2923d2924", "blocks": ["b00027", "b00028"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-1ad2923d2924-c001:a027", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": null, "reason": "错误做法与正确做法形成对比，正确做法强调让孩子自己处理。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-1ad2923d2924-c001:u0026"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
